WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.939
The numbers tell a clear story.

00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:03.762
With a fully optimal expert,

00:00:03.842 --> 00:00:08.321
our method reaches a Q star metric of exactly zero
with zero variance,

00:00:08.401 --> 00:00:10.014
in both low and high data,

00:00:10.094 --> 00:00:17.372
compared to fifty nine point seven five for maximum
likelihood and one hundred forty two for the plain posterior.

00:00:17.452 --> 00:00:21.214
At the hardest setting, epsilon equals four with
high data,

00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:23.298
we score eight point seven nine,

00:00:23.378 --> 00:00:29.485
beating maximum likelihood's twenty point one one
and roughly matching the near optimal expert.

00:00:29.565 --> 00:00:33.848
Accuracy on deterministic states is a constant one
hundred percent,

00:00:33.928 --> 00:00:40.360
and the policy variance collapses from a standard
deviation near fifty two down to essentially zero.
